WEBVTT

00:00:03.216 --> 00:00:07.104
To try an agent on its own, open its Actions menu in the

00:00:07.104 --> 00:00:10.176
list of profiles, and click Invoke Profile.

00:00:10.808 --> 00:00:13.875
Ask it something that fits its job, such as:

00:00:13.875 --> 00:00:16.758
give me three facts about shipping boxes.

00:00:17.233 --> 00:00:18.740
It answers by itself.

00:00:18.740 --> 00:00:22.760
When an assistant calls the agent, this is the kind of answer that

00:00:22.760 --> 00:00:25.943
the assistant gets back, and uses in its own reply.

